<title>AUSTRIA: Prices should rise after OPEC agreement - Saudi minister.</title>
<headline>Prices should rise after OPEC agreement - Saudi minister.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saudi Arabian oil minister Ali bin Ibrahim al-Nuaimi said on Thursday that he expected world oil prices to rise as a result of OPEC's agreement today to freeze output for six months.</p>
<p>Asked by lobby reporters whether prices would rise as a result of the agreement, he replied &quot;of course.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Vienna Newsroom +431 713 2034</p>
</text>
